cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite it as below."
title: "cvlab: from-scratch spatial filtering and Canny edge detection in NumPy"
abstract: >-
  A production-grade implementation of 2D/3D spatial convolution, Gaussian and
  unsharp filtering, pooling with analytical gradients, and a four-stage Canny
  edge detector, built from first principles for industrial defect inspection
  and surface-crack detection. Course project for CS4059 Fundamentals of
  Computer Vision, FAST-NUCES, Fall 2026.
type: software
